<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Brooke Bond net up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Brooke Bond net up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen months to June 30, 1996, vs calendar 1994 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales		   6,137 vs 3,730</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     835 vs   299</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	523 vs   184</p>
<p>    Interim dividend 12.5 pct vs 20 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Final dividend    290 pct vs 60 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Brooke Bond Pakistan Ltd.</p>
<p>Company has changed its financial year to July-June from calendar year. Book closure October 16-23. AGM October 22. Ex-dividend date Oct 16.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
